{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to the <strong>Airport Baggage Simulator</strong> \u2013 My name is G\u00fcnther Gewinn and I\u2019m the boss here! Recently, a position opened up because our previous baggage handler, Rolf, decided to change careers.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3887090/extras/a29d5130a93ea4916364313640834417.avif?t=1767958718\" width=780 height=104 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Flights arrive, and matching baggage is delivered for inspection. You pick up the bags, place them on the table, scan them green or red depending on whether the label is correct, and then place them on the appropriate outgoing conveyor. Afterwards, you load them onto a baggage cart at the gate and take care of the next suitcase.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3887090/extras/f21c36229f37431afbd36ee116846092.poster.avif?t=1767958718\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3887090/extras/f21c36229f37431afbd36ee116846092.webm?t=1767958718\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3887090/extras/f21c36229f37431afbd36ee116846092.mp4?t=1767958718\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3887090/extras/f7c276d7792455bf87963204253dbc64.avif?t=1767958718\" width=780 height=104 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The goal is clear: you want to make the terminal processes more efficient and automated. For that, you can buy conveyor belt sections and machines on your tablet. Eventually, you\u2019ll let the machines handle checking and sorting: baggage gets launched through the air by a thrower module onto the next belt and sorted by a scanner machine without your intervention.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3887090/extras/88bf05017172c7ecfe1dbb1545d30582.poster.avif?t=1767958718\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3887090/extras/88bf05017172c7ecfe1dbb1545d30582.webm?t=1767958718\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3887090/extras/88bf05017172c7ecfe1dbb1545d30582.mp4?t=1767958718\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3887090/extras/0992ffac3e4c2806dd140d024e22732f.avif?t=1767958718\" width=780 height=104 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Our deliveries are reliable: our employee Horst is responsible for bringing in packages. Everything you order on your tablet, he\u2019ll deliver to you in no time and top quality, so you can set it up right in the terminal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3887090/extras/8170c218c378612d76db7b77a65a0c47.poster.avif?t=1767958718\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3887090/extras/8170c218c378612d76db7b77a65a0c47.webm?t=1767958718\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3887090/extras/8170c218c378612d76db7b77a65a0c47.mp4?t=1767958718\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3887090/extras/18aa86dc20e4e1e581d40419ae4a4299.avif?t=1767958718\" width=780 height=104 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Through your work, you can earn promotions and take on new responsibilities. On your tablet, you can also unlock licenses for new inspections, such as weighing suitcases or using the Substance Sniffer. Each new license brings you higher earnings and more variety in your workday.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3887090/extras/69e7ed8897dbb7c59f83e086f1d5bde9.poster.avif?t=1767958718\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3887090/extras/69e7ed8897dbb7c59f83e086f1d5bde9.webm?t=1767958718\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3887090/extras/69e7ed8897dbb7c59f83e086f1d5bde9.mp4?t=1767958718\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3887090/extras/9862b872a9d3f9d0e576efa0f03205a0.avif?t=1767958718\" width=780 height=104 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Inspections &amp; Automation:</strong> You start with manual checks and later build machines that handle every step.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Conveyor Layout:</strong> Plan and build your own conveyor routes to bring baggage efficiently to the right gates and inspections.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgrades &amp; Staff:</strong> Upgrade Horst, speed up the Substance Sniffer, and install automatic release gates or a wall opening to the delivery room.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>New Goals:</strong> Expand the terminal area and earn promotions to take responsibility for more gates and new machines.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Baggage Types:</strong> Unlock different types of baggage for higher earnings.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Commission:</strong> The more responsibility you take on and the fewer mistakes you make, the higher your compensation.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3887090/extras/4390e2581599f7b51e040102a5d163f8.poster.avif?t=1767958718\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3887090/extras/4390e2581599f7b51e040102a5d163f8.webm?t=1767958718\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3887090/extras/4390e2581599f7b51e040102a5d163f8.mp4?t=1767958718\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3887090/extras/0a5d9a2e5a71ea73a294275dca2b5b15.avif?t=1767958718\" width=780 height=104 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you\u2019ve read this far, I have a feeling you\u2019re exactly the right person for this job. Congratulations!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ute Gutgelaunt</strong> from HR will send you all the important info by email on your first day.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I\u2019m looking forward to your first day at work. Always remember: <u>There\u2019s no room for negligence in airport operations!</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Best regards</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>G\u00fcnther Gewinn</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > -Management</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3887090?t=1767958718","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3887090/e54130d5969c120ee541f54eb5cf5d31cecca253/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1767958718","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3887090/9ee01179eb7b0ad65255f6021c50c62199e143a8/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1767958718","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3887090/9ee01179eb7b0ad65255f6021c50c62199e143a8/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1767958718","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3893960,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to the <strong>Airport Baggage Simulator</strong> \u2013 My name is G\u00fcnther Gewinn and I\u2019m the boss here! Recently, a position opened up because our previous baggage handler, Rolf, decided to change careers.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3887090/extras/a29d5130a93ea4916364313640834417.avif?t=1767958718\" width=780 height=104 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Flights arrive, and matching baggage is delivered for inspection. You pick up the bags, place them on the table, scan them green or red depending on whether the label is correct, and then place them on the appropriate outgoing conveyor. Afterwards, you load them onto a baggage cart at the gate and take care of the next suitcase.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3887090/extras/f21c36229f37431afbd36ee116846092.poster.avif?t=1767958718\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3887090/extras/f21c36229f37431afbd36ee116846092.webm?t=1767958718\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3887090/extras/f21c36229f37431afbd36ee116846092.mp4?t=1767958718\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3887090/extras/f7c276d7792455bf87963204253dbc64.avif?t=1767958718\" width=780 height=104 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The goal is clear: you want to make the terminal processes more efficient and automated. For that, you can buy conveyor belt sections and machines on your tablet. Eventually, you\u2019ll let the machines handle checking and sorting: baggage gets launched through the air by a thrower module onto the next belt and sorted by a scanner machine without your intervention.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3887090/extras/88bf05017172c7ecfe1dbb1545d30582.poster.avif?t=1767958718\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3887090/extras/88bf05017172c7ecfe1dbb1545d30582.webm?t=1767958718\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3887090/extras/88bf05017172c7ecfe1dbb1545d30582.mp4?t=1767958718\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3887090/extras/0992ffac3e4c2806dd140d024e22732f.avif?t=1767958718\" width=780 height=104 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Our deliveries are reliable: our employee Horst is responsible for bringing in packages. Everything you order on your tablet, he\u2019ll deliver to you in no time and top quality, so you can set it up right in the terminal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3887090/extras/8170c218c378612d76db7b77a65a0c47.poster.avif?t=1767958718\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3887090/extras/8170c218c378612d76db7b77a65a0c47.webm?t=1767958718\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3887090/extras/8170c218c378612d76db7b77a65a0c47.mp4?t=1767958718\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3887090/extras/18aa86dc20e4e1e581d40419ae4a4299.avif?t=1767958718\" width=780 height=104 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Through your work, you can earn promotions and take on new responsibilities. On your tablet, you can also unlock licenses for new inspections, such as weighing suitcases or using the Substance Sniffer. Each new license brings you higher earnings and more variety in your workday.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3887090/extras/69e7ed8897dbb7c59f83e086f1d5bde9.poster.avif?t=1767958718\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3887090/extras/69e7ed8897dbb7c59f83e086f1d5bde9.webm?t=1767958718\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3887090/extras/69e7ed8897dbb7c59f83e086f1d5bde9.mp4?t=1767958718\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3887090/extras/9862b872a9d3f9d0e576efa0f03205a0.avif?t=1767958718\" width=780 height=104 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Inspections &amp; Automation:</strong> You start with manual checks and later build machines that handle every step.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Conveyor Layout:</strong> Plan and build your own conveyor routes to bring baggage efficiently to the right gates and inspections.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgrades &amp; Staff:</strong> Upgrade Horst, speed up the Substance Sniffer, and install automatic release gates or a wall opening to the delivery room.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>New Goals:</strong> Expand the terminal area and earn promotions to take responsibility for more gates and new machines.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Baggage Types:</strong> Unlock different types of baggage for higher earnings.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Commission:</strong> The more responsibility you take on and the fewer mistakes you make, the higher your compensation.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3887090/extras/4390e2581599f7b51e040102a5d163f8.poster.avif?t=1767958718\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3887090/extras/4390e2581599f7b51e040102a5d163f8.webm?t=1767958718\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3887090/extras/4390e2581599f7b51e040102a5d163f8.mp4?t=1767958718\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3887090/extras/0a5d9a2e5a71ea73a294275dca2b5b15.avif?t=1767958718\" width=780 height=104 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you\u2019ve read this far, I have a feeling you\u2019re exactly the right person for this job. Congratulations!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ute Gutgelaunt</strong> from HR will send you all the important info by email on your first day.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I\u2019m looking forward to your first day at work. Always remember: <u>There\u2019s no room for negligence in airport operations!</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Best regards</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>G\u00fcnther Gewinn</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > -Management</p>","developers":["Three River Games (3RG)"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3887090/747323dfd16b7e6ace2319810ddb908cb2fcac89/header.jpg?t=1767958718","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"(c) 2025 Three River Games.","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3887090/839506983/92f4c3f84f111f0f1035f900e38bc721ee65aee6/1765132496/dash_av1.mpd?t=1765461033","dash_h264":"https://video